atarPartScaleType\"):Destroy()\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend\n\nrm()\nwait(0.5)\nHumanoid:FindFirstChild(\"BodyProportionScale\"):Destroy()\nwait(1)\n\nrm()\nwait(0.5)\nHumanoid:FindFirstChild(\"BodyHeightScale\"):Destroy()\nwait(1)\n\nrm()\nwait(0.5)\nHumanoid:FindFirstChild(\"BodyWidthScale\"):Destroy()\nwait(1)\n\nrm()\nwait(0.5)\nHumanoid:FindFirstChild(\"BodyDepthScale\"):Destroy()\nwait(1)\n\nrm()\nwait(0.5)\nHumanoid:FindFirstChild(\"HeadScale\"):Destroy()\nwait(1)","features":"It can make you really long only need to have your body at\n\nMax height\nMax Width\nMax Head\n0% Proportions\nAnd body type MAX","tags":["Size","big","FE","UNiversal","Long"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"62c3b2fbc18d0c9c5496ddc4","username":"superrarolocosac","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"62c3b2fbc18d0c9c5496ddc4","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T23:38:03.881Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e3b360710ec3c4e0c7","editBy":{"_id":"62c3b2fbc18d0c9c5496ddc4","username":"superrarolocosac","status":"offline","id":"62c3b2fbc18d0c9c5496ddc4"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T22:40:18.475Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"62c4f00ba439e78286ea31b4","commentBy":{"_id":"62c3b2fbc18d0c9c5496ddc4","username":"superrarolocosac","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2022-07-05T03:41:47.408Z","lastActive":"2025-12-08T07:23:01.126Z","status":"offline","id":"62c3b2fbc18d0c9c5496ddc4","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"p